* A global label without parameters in a macro body (Entry: equ *) is exported where the macro is
* called, as r68 does.
* fixed: 28b9071 2026-10-11 r68togas: global labels without parameters in macro bodies exported
* expect sym: T Entry 00000002
* expect sym: T ent2 00000002
mkent macro
Entry: equ *
\1: equ *
 endm
 psect macro_glabel,0,0,0,0,0
 nop
 mkent ent2
 nop
 ends
